    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BIG BLUE MACHINE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Big Blue Machine is a political machine formed by Davis to help the Tories remain in power for fourteen years."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0388-fbd4a22bd55f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BILL DAVIS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Bill Davis is a person who appointed Lawrence as his Attorney-General in 1971 and was the Premier of Ontario from 1971 to 1985."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0388-fbd4a22bd55f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ONTARIO&quot;">
